</div></div></div><div class="pf-c pf-sm-hide pf-hide" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-20_ pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-cwHqhk iHTtwH pf-21_ pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-23_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Check Discount Now</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-f625" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-24_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-25_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-26_"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-27_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-29_">I Tested A Device That Saves You Hours By Automatically Finding &amp; Backing Up Your Photos And Videos With ONE Click… But I Never Expected This!</span></h1></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-61a0" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-30_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-31_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-32_"><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL sc-fPrdjK huUGBz iFszLQ pf-33_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_AZ_Review_Matthew_16x9-46.42_1200x.png?v=1772044250" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPSO_AZ_Review_Matthew_16x9-46.42.png?v=1772044250 1536w" width="1920" height="1080" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="TPSO_AZ Review_Matthew_16x9-46.42.png__PID:8bc39891-e421-4b02-b7a1-9b276d7bd165"/></a><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-37_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-39_"><span style="font-style: italic;">Do you have a lot of photos and videos stored on your computer and/or phone? Read this article closely… it could prevent a tragedy!</span></span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-a8fe" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-34_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-35_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-36_"><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-176_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-bb89ed62-3179-406b-bcda-a648e2e70232"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">As a computer repair technician, I get desperate phone calls from customers every day.<br><br>They usually sound something like this:<br><br><i>“PLEASE help me! I put my phone on the hood of the car for one second and forgot about it when I drove away. </i><b><i>Now it won’t turn on… and I have YEARS of family photos on there.” </i></b><br><br>Or… “<i>I don’t know what happened. I was on my computer playing solitaire when <b>the screen suddenly turned black…</b> I’m afraid to touch it. I JUST moved my vacation photos with my grandchildren to my computer and deleted them off my phone… is there any hope?”</i><br><br>Of course, <b>I tell all my customers to “ALWAYS BACK UP” – but hardly any of them do.</b> And honestly, I understand why – it takes a TON of effort to back up all your most important files!<br><br>First, you have to dig through all those folders across ALL your devices… then organize all your photos and videos… and then you have to go through each file and figure out which ones you’re going to back up, removing the duplicates you’ve already backed up in the past. You can easily spend hundreds of hours going through everything!<br><br>We’d all rather spend our free time doing just about anything else. But get this: <b>140,000 hard drives crash EVERY WEEK in the United States alone…</b><br><br>And as a result, about <b>46% of internet users lose their files every year.</b></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL sc-fPrdjK huUGBz iFszLQ pf-43_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/English_1200x.png?v=1772048573" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/English.png?v=1772048573 1536w" width="1050" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="English.png__PID:5fbd776d-f338-4019-b4f9-782184a80b08"/></a><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-179_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-667db659-99e8-44fd-ae14-e9eaa81e5134"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b>That’s millions of precious memories… lost forever.<br></b><br>To recover them, you either have to figure it out on your own… or pay a technician like me $300 - $500 with no guarantees!<br><br>I get dozens of calls for this every week… and very few end well.<br><br>So naturally, I was MORE than a bit skeptical when my friend called to say he had found <b>a one-of-a-kind gadget that does all your backups FOR YOU… on ALL your devices…</b> and it saves them in ONE secure physical location.<br><br>It sounded unbelievable. I had seen my fair share of flimsy thumb drives and “unhackable” cloud-based services—that just get hacked 2 weeks later.<br><br>But, I decided to test out this new device anyway… mostly to make my friend happy.<br><br>And I was SHOCKED when I discovered that it <b>ACTUALLY WORKS — and it’s both SECURE &amp; EASY</b> to use. Let me explain…<b></b></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-13c8" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-50_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-51_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-52_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-53_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-55_">What Is This New Easy-to-Use Backup Gadget?
</span></h2><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL sc-fPrdjK huUGBz iFszLQ pf-56_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_7_1200x.png?v=1747414399" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_7.png?v=1747414399 1536w" width="1050" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Articles (7).png__PID:bbb46d13-620b-4393-8061-5957e824c7c3"/></a><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-189_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-f947e2d4-3de0-49f0-959f-5f674629c87b"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b>It’s called <a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick Omni</a>.<br></b><br>It’s a revolutionary device that automatically <b>finds, sorts, and saves up to 200,000 photos and videos across ANY of your devices</b> with just ONE click.<br><br>Even better, you only need one of them for all your devices! ThePhotoStick Omni works on:<br>• All Windows computers<br>• All Mac (Apple) computers<br>• All smartphones (iPhones, Android, iOS, etc.)<br>• All tablets (Galaxy, iPad, etc.)<br><br>This means you can now safely store, access, and share ALL of your precious photo and video memories in a matter of minutes… no matter where they are… with ONE device. It’s going to prevent so many irreplaceable photos &amp; videos from being lost!<b></b></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-60_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-61_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-62_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-64_">How Does ThePhotoStick Omni Work?
</span></h2><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-192_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-4602f7e2-15b3-4d74-ba03-8f500a0fdc75"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b></b>This is where I was pleasantly surprised. <b>Most backup systems are WAY too complicated for the average user… which results in a lot of tragic mistakes.</b><br><br>Not only do backups take a LONG time, <b>one little mistake can cause all those precious memories to be erased.</b> And digging through your folders to find all those files is always a nightmare… you’ll never know if you missed an important photo or video until it’s too late.<br><br>But that’s what makes ThePhotoStick Omni different. It does everything FOR YOU in just 3 simple steps:<br><br><strong>STEP 1:</strong> Plug the stick into ANY device that has your photos or videos.<b></b></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL sc-fPrdjK huUGBz iFszLQ pf-68_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_22_1200x.gif?v=1743518805" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_22.gif?v=1743518805 1536w" width="700" height="400" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Articles (22).gif__PID:979d260f-bb46-4649-85a1-176342ea9968"/></a><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-195_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-6740ad5f-405a-4dd2-bdf6-66bd4531ca6b"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b></b><strong>NOTE: </strong>It comes with a universal attachment that will fit onto any computer, phone, or tablet – even if it doesn’t have a USB slot.<b></b></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL sc-fPrdjK huUGBz iFszLQ pf-72_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296_1200x.png?v=1743518300" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T093812.296.png?v=1743518300 1536w" width="1050" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Articles - 2025-04-01T093812.296.png__PID:e2fa0ed6-147e-46ac-8421-98980f35b57c"/></a><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-198_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-cd94b328-44a5-4053-909e-240adcb55c89"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b></b><strong>STEP 2: </strong>Open ThePhotoStick Omni app<b></b></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL sc-fPrdjK huUGBz iFszLQ pf-76_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_2_1200x.png?v=1747412185" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_2.png?v=1747412185 1536w" width="1050" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Articles (2).png__PID:e8eeeaa7-7deb-4673-a422-7526d8d48038"/></a><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-201_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-1f0a72ea-3346-4a65-80a0-c5154f70dbb6"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b></b><strong>STEP 3: </strong>Tap "BACKUP FILES NOW"<b></b></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL sc-fPrdjK huUGBz iFszLQ pf-80_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_3_1200x.png?v=1747412549" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_3.png?v=1747412549 1536w" width="1050" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Articles (3).png__PID:3de22113-ef58-452c-be98-db7f458146ed"/></a><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-204_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-99573b0b-e160-4bdf-9136-7702dd436ae9"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b></b><strong></strong>In the time it takes to walk your dog, ThePhotoStick Omni will scan every inch of your device to find each and every irreplaceable photo or video, and automatically back up ALL your precious memories.<br><br>Even better, it will <b>automatically remove any duplicate files — saving you time while maximizing the storage space on your devices.</b><br><br>Doing this on your own would take you HOURS… and HOURS… and HOURS. And without ThePhotoStick Omni, there’s no guarantee that you’ll find everything — it’s so easy to miss files hidden on your computer!<b></b></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-c294" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-81_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-87_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-88_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-89_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-91_">Even Better: <a href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_self">ThePhotoStick Omni</a> Works On ALL Files!</span></h2><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-207_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-5a1e9d7d-2146-4556-83f0-f3f7db8f5c83"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b></b><strong></strong>Here’s another feature I found to be really helpful: ThePhotoStick Omni will actually find and protect MORE than just photos and videos.<br><br><b>It also backs up documents, voice memos, and music files—over 100 different file types</b>—and helps you organize them all into folders on the stick.<br><br><b>Bonus:</b> This makes it so easy to fix that dreaded “Storage At Maximum Capacity. Please delete files to make room.” pop-up message. Just plug in ThePhotoStick Omni and you’re good to go!<br><br>PLUS… ThePhotoStick Omni isn’t ONLY useful when it comes to backing up your photos.<b></b></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-4a83" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-epRwmx cpmRjY pf-95_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-djVWQC dKziBg"><div class="sc-tafSX ePbmtR pf-96_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-pKreJ bIaXH pf-97_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-kOHUsU fHbtje pf-98_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-cRmpXP cGRimR pf-100_">You’ll Also Save HOURS of Time When You Want to Find Some Photos To Share With Friends &amp; Family</span></h2><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL sc-fPrdjK huUGBz iFszLQ pf-101_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T103042.245_1200x.png?v=1743521453" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_-_2025-04-01T103042.245.png?v=1743521453 1536w" width="1050" height="600" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Articles - 2025-04-01T103042.245.png__PID:b8ae2d34-d0bc-45a6-babf-cfb8d98d9541"/></a><p class="sc-hgRQsa gNGIPQ pf-210_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-83de893f-3ee6-4091-914e-5752be254a79"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><b>Sharing with ThePhotoStick Omni is easy!</b> Just select the photo you'd like to share...<b></b></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://track.thephotostickquiz.com/action/1" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-iLLNPL sc-fPrdjK huUGBz iFszLQ pf-105_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/Articles_5_1200x.png?v=